    - target: {fileID: 4384868639495170732, guid: 0ab3a1a88f0d4d740813b2dd702b006d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Echoes are alternate versions of Caleb who will shift slightly into
        his reality to help out under various circumstances.\n\nEach echo can have
        a combination of Calebs skillset. But most Echoes won't have them all.\n\nThe
        main difference in Echo behaviour comes from whether or not they are combat
        enabled.\nCombat enabled Echoes have two different styles depending on whether
        or not they can also complete tasks. \n\nA combat enabled Echo that does
        NOT have the ability to do tasks will seek out enemies specifically.\nA combat
        enabled Echo that DOES have the ability to do tasks will prioritize tasks
        over combat and only engage enemies that see them.\n\nEchoes that do not
        have combat will not be targetted by or target enemies.\n\nDev Note | Right
        now there are no echoes in the game that can do both combat and tasks. Echoes
        from Milestones specifically seek out tasks for that skills milestone EG
        an echo spawned with woodcutting will only seek out woodcutting tasks."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
